OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fwindy with showers continuing into the
OL,7,Fovernight period, winds strengthening
OL,8,Fto gales for a time for the North
OL,9,Fcoast and backing northwesterly so
OL,10,Ffeeling quite cool later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FWinds gradually easing during
OL,13,Fthe day and showers finally becoming
OL,14,Fless frequent with some bright and dry
OL,15,Fweather for the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
