OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,Fto start the day on Monday but this
OL,7,Fwill become patchy and turning warmer.
OL,8,FMild on Tuesday, rain spreading east
OL,9,Flater. Fresher Wednesday with bright
OL,10,Fspells, a few showers.
